# Agent memories are local only. They name hosts, accounts, key fingerprints
# and hardware, and this repository is public. The live store is
# ~/.agents/memory/, outside this repo; these patterns are a guard in case a
# copy ever lands inside it.
agents/.agents/memory/
**/.agents/memory/
**/MEMORY.md

# fish runtime state, not authored config. `stow --no-folding fish` keeps
# ~/.config/fish a real directory so these are never created inside the repo;
# these patterns are a guard in case a plain `stow fish` folds it in later.
# fish_variables carries fish_user_paths and prompt colours; uv.env.fish is
# generated by the uv installer and sources a machine-local path.
fish/.config/fish/fish_variables
fish/.config/fish/conf.d/uv.env.fish
